WEBVTT

00:00:03.200 --> 00:00:06.370
This is Cook County Cooks, cookcountycooks.com.

00:00:06.480 --> 00:00:10.380
Every tool you use on the sales floor lives in this one building.

00:00:10.420 --> 00:00:12.490
So let's take the tour.

00:00:13.312 --> 00:00:17.742
Getting around is easy. Scroll, and you walk from room to room.

00:00:17.872 --> 00:00:20.542
The menu across the top jumps straight to any room.

00:00:20.812 --> 00:00:24.272
Tap Find a tool to search by name, or hit the C³ button in

00:00:24.312 --> 00:00:25.762
the corner for the full list.

00:00:25.912 --> 00:00:27.882
Every tool opens right here on the site.

00:00:28.032 --> 00:00:30.982
Close it, and you're right back where you left off.

00:00:32.507 --> 00:00:36.337
First stop: The Pass. These are the tools you touch on every sale.

00:00:36.487 --> 00:00:40.117
The 6th Gen Mobile Quote Sheet builds a full Xfinity Mobile quote

00:00:40.287 --> 00:00:42.637
, lines, devices, trade-ins and promos.

00:00:42.807 --> 00:00:46.167
The Upgrade Quote Sheet prices out device upgrades for customers

00:00:46.207 --> 00:00:48.447
who already have Xfinity Mobile.

00:00:48.487 --> 00:00:52.347
The Internet Quote Sheet works out internet plans and bundle pricing.

00:00:52.387 --> 00:00:55.347
And T-Sheet Submissions keeps every quote you've submitted in one

00:00:55.387 --> 00:00:57.817
place, so you can track it and follow up.

00:00:59.508 --> 00:01:03.478
Next, the Host Stand. The screen up front shows today's mobile promo.

00:01:03.668 --> 00:01:06.858
The Daily Sales Report has every store's numbers for the day.

00:01:06.928 --> 00:01:10.368
And Yesterday's Conversion shows how yesterday's traffic turned

00:01:10.408 --> 00:01:12.298
into sales, store by store.

00:01:13.919 --> 00:01:17.229
In the Dining Room, the boards on the wall are live.

00:01:17.539 --> 00:01:22.129
Win the Weekend Chicago and Win the Weekend Big South are the weekend

00:01:22.319 --> 00:01:25.459
leaderboards, who's on top, and what it takes to get there.

00:01:25.499 --> 00:01:30.039
And the NPS Report shows Medallia scores by store, what customers

00:01:30.079 --> 00:01:32.169
are really saying about their visit.

00:01:33.923 --> 00:01:36.953
The Prep Station holds the recipe cards for the tricky stuff.

00:01:37.203 --> 00:01:40.303
PortPro has account numbers, PINs and port-out steps for more than

00:01:40.343 --> 00:01:44.343
20 carriers. Credit Limit Increase sends a credit review when

00:01:44.383 --> 00:01:47.053
a customer needs more lines than their limit allows.

00:01:47.423 --> 00:01:50.683
The Exception Report shows the transactions that didn't go by the

00:01:50.723 --> 00:01:55.673
book. Request Access walks you through getting into Celestial, CSG,

00:01:55.783 --> 00:01:58.203
Einstein 360 and the rest.

00:01:58.243 --> 00:02:01.423
And the Fall-Off Summary shows sales that fell off before install

00:02:01.463 --> 00:02:04.033
or activation, so you can chase them back.

00:02:05.754 --> 00:02:08.954
The Back Office is where the paperwork and the how-to binders live.

00:02:08.994 --> 00:02:13.194
The TV counts the days since each store's last bad NPS survey.

00:02:13.234 --> 00:02:18.654
Print Outs has the forms and flyers, ready to preview and print.

00:02:18.694 --> 00:02:22.874
BAPIS walks you through packing, handing over and unpacking online

00:02:22.914 --> 00:02:24.434
orders picked up in store.

00:02:24.474 --> 00:02:28.624
Internet Essentials shows you how to set your Sales ID, so you get

00:02:28.714 --> 00:02:31.684
paid, then walks the customer through the application.

00:02:31.774 --> 00:02:34.934
Xfinity Product Mastery is the full product training, with a quiz

00:02:34.974 --> 00:02:39.864
at the end. CSG How To is step-by-step order entry, with the real

00:02:40.114 --> 00:02:43.584
screens. The Celestial Job Aid covers check-ins, sales, returns,

00:02:43.934 --> 00:02:45.684
and opening and closing the store.

00:02:45.794 --> 00:02:50.034
And the eSIM Activation Guide gets any phone, tablet or watch onto

00:02:50.074 --> 00:02:52.394
Xfinity Mobile, QR codes included.

00:02:52.434 --> 00:02:55.024
A few of the how-to guides on the site need a passcode.

00:02:55.134 --> 00:02:56.104
Just ask your manager.

00:02:57.827 --> 00:02:59.107
Last stop: the Break Room.

00:02:59.147 --> 00:03:02.657
That's the Head Chef wall, this week's top performers from every

00:03:03.127 --> 00:03:05.447
district. Tap a photo to see why they won.

00:03:05.487 --> 00:03:08.247
Commission Payouts shows what every sale pays out.

00:03:08.287 --> 00:03:11.807
The Rep Hourly Rate Estimate shows how your month is tracking, and

00:03:11.847 --> 00:03:13.947
what that works out to per hour.

00:03:13.987 --> 00:03:17.787
Got an idea, or a gripe? Drop it in the Suggestion Box.

00:03:17.827 --> 00:03:19.887
It's anonymous, and it goes straight to Jeff.

00:03:19.927 --> 00:03:24.237
And when you're on break, the C³ Arcade has six games:

00:03:24.627 --> 00:03:29.297
Fox Run, After Hours, Deep Six, Blufox Overdrive, the Blufox Casino,

00:03:29.607 --> 00:03:30.817
and Windy City Derby.

00:03:32.271 --> 00:03:34.611
That's the whole kitchen. Cookcountycooks.com.

00:03:34.651 --> 00:03:38.621
Bookmark it, use it on every sale, and go win the weekend.
